id: camouflage-exit
name: Camouflage: Exit
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
fromTrait: camouflage
fromEffect: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Camouflage's first effect: out of the Invisible State, as an Instant Maneuver.
text: >
  (1)-[1/Round]: Spend 1 Action and 8(bT) Ki Points to enter the Invisible Special State. You can exit the Invisible State at any time as an Instant Maneuver.

---

[on used]
leaveState(invisible);
remove(camouflaged);
